      </li>
      <li class="pl-6 relative">
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-2 w-2 h-px bg-brass-mid"></span>
        空间观所属的<strong class="text-cream">六观体系</strong> → <a href="/values" class="text-brass-mid hover:text-brass-bright">/values</a>
      </li>
      <li class="pl-6 relative">
